WEBVTT

04:22.887 --> 04:25.577
<b>Jaadugar</b>

05:52.127 --> 05:57.357
<b>The Roses That Bloom in Safar</b>

06:30.227 --> 06:31.897
<i>Highness! I've found it!</i>

06:36.567 --> 06:37.727
<i>This is it.</i>

06:44.067 --> 06:45.027
<i>Hmm...</i>

06:45.987 --> 06:48.577
<i>So this is Euclid's </i>Elements<i>.</i>

06:58.457 --> 06:59.627
<i>You're certain?</i>

07:00.337 --> 07:01.507
<i>Y-Yes, Highness!</i>

07:03.177 --> 07:04.137
<i>Ha ha ha!</i>

07:04.467 --> 07:06.577
<i>Then it was worth coming all this way.</i>

07:07.807 --> 07:09.887
<i>What of the other books, sire?</i>

07:14.147 --> 07:16.607
<i>I've no need of them. Do with them as you wish.</i>

07:17.357 --> 07:17.857
<i>Sire.</i>

07:39.747 --> 07:40.667
<i>What did she say?</i>

07:41.167 --> 07:42.217
<i>Um...</i>

07:43.087 --> 07:46.217
<i>She said you should return the stolen book, sire.</i>

07:47.347 --> 07:49.347
<i>You malign me as a thief?</i>

07:51.807 --> 07:52.747
<i>You are mistaken.</i>

07:53.557 --> 07:54.957
<i>As the sun touches the whole world,</i>

07:55.477 --> 08:00.317
<i>so everything on it belongs to my father,
 the great Genghis Khan!</i>

08:10.287 --> 08:11.327
<i>Girl.</i>

08:12.407 --> 08:14.307
<i>You are quite the brave one, aren't you?</i>

08:16.287 --> 08:17.517
<i>It is unseemly.</i>

08:18.287 --> 08:19.587
<i>A delicate thing like you</i>

08:20.087 --> 08:21.707
<i>should know but one thing.</i>

08:23.297 --> 08:24.277
<i>And that is fear.</i>

12:16.987 --> 12:18.067
<i>Get up!</i>

12:18.737 --> 12:19.777
<i>We're leaving!</i>

16:55.557 --> 17:02.897
<b>Tus</b>

16:55.557 --> 17:02.897
<b>Taloqan</b>

17:06.237 --> 17:07.197
<i>Get out!</i>

18:28.687 --> 18:32.027
<i>Mav Baliq, the Bad Town,
spilled the blood of my blood.</i>

18:32.817 --> 18:38.867
<i>Kill every living thing your eyes fall upon.
Spare nothing. Not a single dog or bird.</i>

23:38.067 --> 23:43.257
<b>An Undying Flame</b>
